    <div class="toolbar"><input class="search" id="reviewSearch" placeholder="Search customer name or review…"><select class="filter" id="reviewFilter"><option value="all">All reviews</option><option value="pending">Pending</option><option value="approved">Approved</option><option value="rejected">Rejected</option><option value="legacy">Older reviews (no status)</option></select></div>
    <div class="panel"><div class="table-wrap"><table class="data-table"><thead><tr><th>CUSTOMER</th><th>RATING</th><th>MESSAGE</th><th>STATUS</th><th>ACTION</th></tr></thead><tbody id="reviewRows"><tr><td colspan="5" class="empty">Loading reviews…</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class="note">Older reviews created before moderation was enabled may appear as “Older / Unmoderated”. Approve them here if you want them shown publicly. Public website and Firestore rules must also be updated to hide unapproved reviews.</p></div>
   </section>

   <section id="page-website" class="section">
    <div class="pagehead"><div><h1>Website</h1><p>Quick links to your TechVibe online presence.</p></div></div>
    <div class="panel"><h2>TechVibe Cooling Solutions</h2><p class="note">Open the public website in a new tab to check the customer experience.</p><p><a href="https://agilnivedan.github.io/TechVibe-Cooling--Solutions-/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color:var(--ice);font-weight:800">Open TechVibe Website ↗</a></p><p class="note">Dashboard data is protected by your Firestore security rules. Never share your admin password.</p></div>
   </section>
